  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List I with List II :</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">List I</td>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">List II</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A.</td>\t\t\t<td>Saccharin</td>\t\t\t<td>I.</td>\t\t\t<td>High potency sweetener</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B.</td>\t\t\t<td>Aspartame</td>\t\t\t<td>II.</td>\t\t\t<td>First artificial sweetening agent</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td>Alitame</td>\t\t\t<td>III.</td>\t\t\t<td>Stable at cooking temperature</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D.</td>\t\t\t<td>Sucralose</td>\t\t\t<td>IV.</td>\t\t\t<td>Unstable at cooking temperature</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
